WEBVTT

00:00:03.976 --> 00:00:06.022
Hi, Caren. Hi, Pandragora.

00:00:06.196 --> 00:00:07.589
Welcome, Mavis. Hey, guys.

00:00:09.286 --> 00:00:12.420
Yeah,
you're gonna dig it here.
Don't even worry.

00:00:12.594 --> 00:00:15.814
People are totally cool
with our lifestyle choice.

00:00:15.988 --> 00:00:17.120
[DOORBELL DINGS] I mean, the kids get
picked on a little,

00:00:17.294 --> 00:00:19.470
but it toughens them up.

00:00:19.644 --> 00:00:21.298
LINDA: Oh, hey, you guys.
And this is Loretta.

00:00:21.472 --> 00:00:23.257
She's married to Paul,
who's a werewolf.

00:00:23.431 --> 00:00:25.694
Excuse me?

00:00:25.868 --> 00:00:28.436
Yes, I was telling Mavis
about the other
monster-human couples in town.

00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:30.351
I am not a werewolf.

00:00:30.525 --> 00:00:33.092
Oh. I thought...

00:00:33.267 --> 00:00:35.791
Well, you're welcome to stay
and have some cupcakes.
[CHUCKLES]

00:00:37.184 --> 00:00:39.316
[DOOR CLOSES]

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:43.407
ALL:
♪ Vampires will
be friends forever

00:00:43.581 --> 00:00:47.672
♪ Through
the centuries together

00:00:47.846 --> 00:00:51.894
♪ Even in
the brightest sunny weather

00:00:52.068 --> 00:00:56.072
♪ Vampires will
be friends forever

00:00:56.246 --> 00:00:59.684
♪ Literally

00:00:59.858 --> 00:01:03.035
♪ Forever ♪

00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:03.993
[ALL CHEERING]

00:01:06.996 --> 00:01:09.651
Great job, vampires.
Give yourselves a hug.

00:01:09.825 --> 00:01:10.521
ALL: Mmm...

00:01:15.874 --> 00:01:16.832
We're going.

00:01:17.006 --> 00:01:17.659
What? Where?

00:01:24.361 --> 00:01:25.971
MURRAY: Why are we doing this?

00:01:26.145 --> 00:01:28.583
You'd rather be listening
to those putrid new songs?

00:01:28.757 --> 00:01:30.672
What happened to
Michael Row
Your Corpse Ashore?

00:01:30.846 --> 00:01:33.327
Or Old McWerewolf Had An Axe?

00:01:38.810 --> 00:01:40.508
We shouldn't be up here, Drac.

00:01:40.682 --> 00:01:42.597
Who's ready to fly?

00:01:42.771 --> 00:01:44.860
Me! Me! Like a superhero.

00:01:45.034 --> 00:01:46.818
Better! Like a vampire!

00:01:47.776 --> 00:01:49.604
This thing is rickety.

00:01:49.778 --> 00:01:51.997
You know what?
Maybe the kid
isn't supposed to fly.

00:01:52.171 --> 00:01:55.349
Quiet. This is how they learn.
You throw them and
they figure it out.

00:01:56.393 --> 00:01:57.829
It's how I was taught.

00:01:58.003 --> 00:01:59.875
I wanna fly now!

00:02:00.049 --> 00:02:02.660
Attabat.
You know Papa's right here
if you need him.

00:02:02.834 --> 00:02:04.140
Uh. I can't watch this.

00:02:04.314 --> 00:02:05.707
Please don't.

00:02:05.881 --> 00:02:08.231
Here we go!

00:02:08.405 --> 00:02:09.319
DENNIS: Wee!

00:02:14.716 --> 00:02:15.847
He's still not flying.

00:02:16.021 --> 00:02:17.022
He will.

00:02:18.372 --> 00:02:19.721
Still not.

00:02:19.895 --> 00:02:20.765
It'll happen.

00:02:22.071 --> 00:02:23.333
This is a tall tower.

00:02:23.507 --> 00:02:24.900
That's why it's good.

00:02:25.074 --> 00:02:26.205
You should get him.

00:02:26.380 --> 00:02:27.337
He's gonna fall to his death.

00:02:27.511 --> 00:02:29.252
He's taking his time.

00:02:29.426 --> 00:02:30.688
[DENNIS YELLING]

00:02:30.862 --> 00:02:32.211
Drac!

00:02:32.386 --> 00:02:34.257
I did that my first time.

00:02:34.431 --> 00:02:35.954
He's getting too
close to the ground!

00:02:37.434 --> 00:02:38.740
You know what?
He's not gonna fly.

00:02:40.002 --> 00:02:40.742
[ALL GASPING]

00:02:41.482 --> 00:02:42.396
[CHEERING]

00:02:43.179 --> 00:02:44.006
[GASPS]

00:02:46.356 --> 00:02:47.314
Ah.

00:02:49.446 --> 00:02:52.319
I told you.
Papa's always here for you.

00:02:52.493 --> 00:02:54.712
Again! Again!

00:02:54.886 --> 00:02:57.411
Oh, dear. Oh, my devil.
We're gonna have
to report this.

00:02:57.585 --> 00:02:59.543
You mean to the papers?

00:02:59.717 --> 00:03:02.459
I guess it was pretty cool,
but I'm not
about getting press.

00:03:02.633 --> 00:03:05.027
No, sir.
I mean the authorities.

00:03:05.201 --> 00:03:07.508
I can't not report
child endangerment.

00:03:07.682 --> 00:03:10.380
Whoa!
Listen to me. That was fun.

00:03:10.554 --> 00:03:12.774
Your singing is
child endangerment.

00:03:12.948 --> 00:03:14.906
Should we go
down and help him?

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:17.779
Nope.
I told him this was nuts.
He's on his own.

00:03:17.953 --> 00:03:19.302
We have to call
the boy's mother.

00:03:19.476 --> 00:03:20.956
No, that ain't happening.

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:23.567
His mother's
already nutsy koo koo!

00:03:23.741 --> 00:03:26.265
I have to follow protocol.

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:29.878
You will not follow protocol.

00:03:30.052 --> 00:03:31.967
I'm a vampire.
I can't be hypnotized.

00:03:32.794 --> 00:03:34.273
Right.

00:03:34.448 --> 00:03:36.450
Now, please. Don't
make me call the police.

00:03:36.624 --> 00:03:38.365
No one's calling nobody!

00:03:39.235 --> 00:03:40.149
[EXPLOSION]

00:03:40.323 --> 00:03:41.193
FRANKENSTEIN: Aah!

00:03:41.368 --> 00:03:43.065
Fire!

00:03:43.239 --> 00:03:45.720
MURRAY: Stop, drop and roll.
Stop, drop and roll.

00:03:45.894 --> 00:03:47.112
GRIFFIN:
Screaming's not helping!

00:03:47.286 --> 00:03:47.983
ALL: Yay!

00:03:55.904 --> 00:03:57.645
Are we bad guys, Papa Drac?

00:03:58.297 --> 00:03:59.168
Bad?

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:03.868
No. You're
the best kid in the world.

00:04:04.042 --> 00:04:07.263
We didn't start the fire.
It was the tower.

00:04:07.437 --> 00:04:11.746
That's a very unsafe tower.
You're lucky we don't
call the authorities.

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:13.661
Let's go, my hero.

00:04:13.835 --> 00:04:16.403
Cebause I'm Batman!
To the Batmobile!

00:04:16.577 --> 00:04:18.056
[CHUCKLES] Yes. To the...

00:04:20.929 --> 00:04:21.669
[CLATTERING]

00:04:22.974 --> 00:04:23.671
[WAYNE BARKING]

00:04:24.976 --> 00:04:25.890
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:04:29.633 --> 00:04:32.114
Sorry about all that stuff.
I guess they
thought you'd like it.

00:04:32.288 --> 00:04:34.290
Why do I feel so weird here?

00:04:34.464 --> 00:04:36.510
No, hon. They're being weird.

00:04:36.684 --> 00:04:38.990
I think they're
just trying to help me.

00:04:39.164 --> 00:04:42.516
I mean,
I grew up knowing nothing
living inside that hotel.

00:04:42.690 --> 00:04:45.475
And you learned
about everything
growing up in Santa Claus.

00:04:45.649 --> 00:04:48.043
Santa Cruz. But, uh...

00:04:48.217 --> 00:04:50.872
Maybe if Dennis grows up
away from Transylvania,

00:04:51.046 --> 00:04:54.876
he won't be so freaky.
Like me.

00:04:55.050 --> 00:04:58.445
Are you nuts?
Mavis, you're a blast.

00:04:58.619 --> 00:05:01.360
You're so full of life
and curious about everything.

00:05:01.535 --> 00:05:03.667
If Dennis grows up
to be just like you,

00:05:03.841 --> 00:05:05.800
I'll be
the luckiest dad in the world.

00:05:05.974 --> 00:05:08.933
[CHUCKLES] I love you,
Johnnystein.

00:05:09.107 --> 00:05:10.848
You know what?

00:05:11.022 --> 00:05:13.285
As long as we're all together,
we'll be happy anywhere.

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:14.896
Even at the hotel.

00:05:16.071 --> 00:05:17.594
Yes!

00:05:17.768 --> 00:05:18.595
[CELL PHONE RINGING]

00:05:20.205 --> 00:05:21.685
What are you doing? [DENNIS YELLING]

00:05:21.859 --> 00:05:23.948
Check out this
video my friend sent me.

00:05:24.122 --> 00:05:26.081
This kid is
an awesome daredevil.

00:05:27.212 --> 00:05:28.213
Ah.

00:05:28.387 --> 00:05:29.214
Oh, dude!

00:05:29.388 --> 00:05:30.346
Did you get it?

00:05:30.520 --> 00:05:32.609
Wait! Is that Dennis?

00:05:32.783 --> 00:05:36.439
No! Is it?
No. It's just hard to see.
But... [NERVOUS CHUCKLE]

00:05:36.613 --> 00:05:38.963
Oops. Just deleted it.
So, it's gone.

00:05:39.137 --> 00:05:39.964
[GROANS]

00:05:44.795 --> 00:05:45.666
[CELL PHONE VIBRATING]

00:05:49.713 --> 00:05:51.715
What? It's Mavis.
I'm not answering it.

00:05:53.761 --> 00:05:55.719
Come on, Drac. You have to.

00:05:57.112 --> 00:05:58.156
[SIREN WAILING]

00:05:58.330 --> 00:05:59.941
All right!

00:06:00.115 --> 00:06:01.464
Yes, honeybunch.

00:06:01.638 --> 00:06:03.335
Dad? Where are you?

00:06:03.510 --> 00:06:07.209
Um... We're outside the hotel
having a little cookout.

00:06:07.383 --> 00:06:08.906
It's perfectly safe.

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:10.995
What's that noise?
Is that a siren?

00:06:11.169 --> 00:06:13.737
Oh, those are just
some wailing banshees
checking in.

00:06:13.911 --> 00:06:15.870
Quiet, you banshees.

00:06:16.044 --> 00:06:18.437
We're trying to have
a perfectly safe
cookout over here.

00:06:18.612 --> 00:06:22.093
Mommy!
I wanna say hi! Mommy! Mommy!

00:06:22.267 --> 00:06:23.573
Papa Drac just tried
to teach me how to fly.

00:06:23.747 --> 00:06:25.096
Wait a minute.
Is that the mother?

00:06:25.270 --> 00:06:26.663
Oh, no. Static again.

00:06:28.012 --> 00:06:30.145
I am coming back to
the hotel right now.

00:06:30.319 --> 00:06:34.018
And you better be
there or I swear, Dad,
you're gonna be very sorry.

00:06:34.845 --> 00:06:36.760
What's goin' on?

00:06:36.934 --> 00:06:37.979
We need to get
home right away.

00:06:38.153 --> 00:06:38.980
Whoa!

00:06:40.634 --> 00:06:43.158
Okay.
I'll go wake up my backpack.

00:06:43.332 --> 00:06:44.812
Guys, we gotta move.

00:06:44.986 --> 00:06:47.162
We got no car!
How we gonna get out of here?

00:06:47.336 --> 00:06:48.816
GRIFFIN: Don't worry.
I made a call.

00:06:55.474 --> 00:06:55.997
[MAKING NONSENSICAL SOUNDS]

00:06:58.390 --> 00:07:01.306
I'm sorry, Blobby.
We really meant
to call you sooner.

00:07:07.835 --> 00:07:09.053
Hit it!

